# Skills directory policy
#
# Only local/hand-written skills are tracked here. Everything else is
# github-sourced and restored on demand by the skills CLI from the
# repo-tracked lockfile (../.skill-lock.json), so it is not committed.
#
# Ignore every skill folder...
*/
# ...then re-include the local/hand-written ones (absent from .skill-lock.json).
!gitnexus-*/
